    "ls_intro": {
      "type": "content-block",
      "blocks": {
        "ti": {
          "type": "description_title",
          "settings": {
            "title_text": "Keep Crews Installing, Not Driving",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "title_padding_top": 24,
            "title_padding_bottom": 12
          }
        },
        "bi": {
          "type": "description_body",
          "settings": {
            "body_text": "<p>Every hour a crew spends chasing a fitting at three different counters is an hour that isn't billable. ASIW Supply consolidates the landscape install into one order — heads, rotors, valves, controllers, Schedule 40 PVC, fittings, and the pump that feeds the system — from brands your crews already trust: Hunter, Rain Bird, Toro, Netafim, Charlotte Pipe, Lesso, Goulds, and Berkeley.</p><p>We work the way contractors work. Tell us what the plan calls for and we'll build the takeoff, cut pipe to your lengths, and stage the order so it lands complete. Whether you're irrigating a new subdivision, retrofitting a commercial property, or maintaining an HOA portfolio, you get one point of contact and pricing that holds up when you bid the job.</p>",
            "body_padding_top": 0,
            "body_padding_bottom": 24
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "ti",
        "bi"
      ],
