    "ls_faq": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "q1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you offer contractor pricing for landscaping companies?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Landscape contractors, irrigation installers, and maintenance companies can apply for a trade account to get volume pricing across sprinklers, PVC pipe and fittings, controllers, valves, and pumps. Apply using the form on this page.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can you cut PVC pipe to the lengths on my plan?",
            "answer": "<p>We cut Schedule 40 PVC to your specifications in diameters from 1-1/2\" to 4\". Send us the cut list with your order and it ships ready to install — no field cutting, less scrap, fewer glued joints.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Which irrigation brands do you stock?",
            "answer": "<p>We're an authorized distributor for Hunter, Rain Bird, Toro, Netafim, Weathermatic, and Bermad on the irrigation side, Charlotte Pipe, Lesso, and Dura for pipe and fittings, and Goulds, Berkeley, Sta-Rite, Franklin Electric, and Grundfos for pumps. Everything is genuine and factory-warrantied.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can you help size a pump or lay out zones before I bid?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes — that's what our team is here for. Send the plan, the water source details, and the coverage you need, and we'll help size pump capacity, zone counts, and pipe runs so your bid is based on real numbers. Call (772) 468-0888.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you supply repair and replacement parts too?",
            "answer": "<p>We do. Along with new installs we stock repair kits, impellers, casings, and seals for more than 100 Berkeley pump models and the full Goulds J, JS, and GT series — so a service call doesn't turn into a full replacement.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "q1",
        "q2",
        "q3",
        "q4",
        "q5"
